quran[16]{c,v,t}:
  36,55,"Indeed, on that Day, the people of Paradise will be busy enjoying themselves."
  36,56,"They and their spouses will be in (cool) shades, reclining on couches."
  36,57,"They shall have fruits there, and they shall have whatever they ask for."
  36,58,‘Peace!’ (It will be) a word (of greeting) from the All-Merciful Lord.
  36,59,"(And it would be said:) ‘Get apart today, O evildoers!’"
  36,60,"‘Did I not command you, O Children of Adam, that you should not worship Satan? He is indeed your open enemy."
  36,61,And that you should worship Me. This is a straight path.
  36,62,"Yet, he has already misled many of your generations. Did you still not understand?"
  36,63,This is the Hell that you were promised!
  36,64,Enter it today because of what you used to deny.’
  36,65,"That Day, We will seal their mouths. Their hands will speak to Us, and their feet will bear witness to what they used to earn."
  36,66,"Had We wished, We would have blotted out their eyes. Then, if they had advanced towards the path, how could they see?"
  36,67,"If We had wished, We would have deformed (or paralysed) them at their places. Then, they could neither go ahead nor turn back."
  36,68,"And whoever We grant a long life, We cause him to reverse in development (and strength). Do they not yet understand?"
  36,69,"We did not teach him poetry, nor is it befitting for him. This (Book) is only a Reminder and a manifest Qur’an."
  36,70,"So he may warn whoever is alive, and the decree (of Allah) may prove true against the disbelievers."
